ing Slime-tacular Details</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the squishy splats to the slick slides, every sound, movement, and animation is a satisfying treat for your senses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/39edebce69eb75dbef87ccb8fe48b7a0.poster.avif?t=1753800938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/39edebce69eb75dbef87ccb8fe48b7a0.webm?t=1753800938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/39edebce69eb75dbef87ccb8fe48b7a0.mp4?t=1753800938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find Your Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re looking for challenging difficulty or relaxing sliding slimes, zone out for hours of satisfying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/8a0fe1af48784c92aa3c332885ed64db.poster.avif?t=1753800938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/8a0fe1af48784c92aa3c332885ed64db.webm?t=1753800938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/8a0fe1af48784c92aa3c332885ed64db.mp4?t=1753800938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 unique hand-crafted puzzles to slip \u2018n slide through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The CUTEST slime you\u2019ve ever seen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warm and cozy hand-drawn pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the enchanting Autumn Forest, the mystical Crystal Caves, the magical Wizard\u2019s Tower, and other unique biomes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual fun with optional challenges \u2013 can you solve them all?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect to pick up and play for a few minutes, or binge in a day, it\u2019s your choice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super satisfying sounds and music bring the world to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available in ALL LANGUAGES due to no in-game text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So easy to learn even your grandma can play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/57c4851b3abb63f8ca3db4b4acc5f1d7.poster.avif?t=1753800938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/57c4851b3abb63f8ca3db4b4acc5f1d7.webm?t=1753800938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151990/extras/57c4851b3abb63f8ca3db4b4acc5f1d7.mp4?t=1753800938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
